flowchart LR
  customer[Customer\nUses the mobile bank]
  security[Security analyst\nReviews selected cases]
  system[Outgoing transfer anti-fraud system\nChecks transfer risk and routes the decision]
  app[Mobile bank\nTransfer creation and warnings]
  rail[Payment rail and recipient bank\nExecutes an approved transfer]
  cbr[Bank of Russia risk data\nRisk recipient and device signals]

  customer -->|creates transfer and receives result| app
  app -->|transfer request and confirmation| system
  system -->|approve or suspend decision| app
  system -->|approved transfer| rail
  cbr -->|regulatory risk signals| system
  system -->|manual-review case| security
  security -->|approve or reject decision| system
